      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有中容之国，帝俊生中容，中容人食兽、木实，使四"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-05",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "这里指帝舜"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "不庭之山，荣水穷焉。有人三身，帝俊妻娥皇，生此三身之国，姚姓，黍"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-10",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "这里指帝喾"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-10",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有重阴之山。有人食兽，曰季釐。帝俊生季釐，故曰季釐之国。有缗渊。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-16-18",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "这里指帝喾(kù)"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-16-18",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有女子方浴月。帝俊妻常羲，生月十有二，此始浴之。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "皆出卫于山。丘方员三百里，丘南帝俊竹林在焉，大可为舟。竹南有赤泽"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-20",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "帝俊生禺号，禺号生淫梁，淫梁生番禺"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-21",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "帝俊生三身，三身生义均，义均是始为"
    }
  ],
